<title>USA: Rogers, Ark., deal yields five pct in 2015 - Llama.</title>
<headline>Rogers, Ark., deal yields five pct in 2015 - Llama.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Llama Co said Tuesday it tentatively priced $38.7 million Rogers, Ark., sales and use tax bonds at a top yield of five percent in 2015.</p>
<p>The preliminary pricing follows:</p>
<p>CITY OF ROGERS, ARKANSAS</p>
<p>RE: $38,650,000*</p>
<p>SALES AND USE TAX BONDS</p>
<p>SERIES 1996</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: A1		    S&amp;P: AA</p>
<p>    DATED: 11/01/1996	  FIRST COUPON: 05/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 11/01</p>
<p>ALL BONDS ARE PRICED AT PAR.</p>
<p>MATURITY		 AMOUNT*    COUPON</p>
<p>11/01/1997		1,250M    3.80  %</p>
<p>11/01/1998		1,365M    4.10  %</p>
<p>11/01/1999		1,420M    4.25  %</p>
<p>11/01/2000		1,480M    4.40  %</p>
<p>11/01/2001		1,545M    4.50  %</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>11/01/2002		1,615M    4.60  %</p>
<p>11/01/2003		1,690M    4.70  %</p>
<p>11/01/2004		1,770M    4.80  %</p>
<p>11/01/2005		1,855M    4.90  %</p>
<p>11/01/2006		1,945M    5.00  %</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>11/01/2007		2,040M    5.10  %</p>
<p>11/01/2011		9,290M    5.35  %</p>
<p>11/01/2015	     11,385M    5.00  %</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: 11/01/2007    100.00</p>
<p>* - APPROXIMATE SUBJECT TO CHANGE</p>
<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award is expected</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on November 19, 1996.</p>
<p>This issue is pending through DTC.</p>
<p>Llama Company</p>
<p>A.G. Edwards &amp; Sons, Inc.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
